	quest.03D94E95B8F7EEC7.quest_desc: [
		"The Digital Age brings HV and EV power, digital circuits and nuclear energy. Everything is more complex, so follow the quests closely."
		""
		"Start by building a Robot Arm. You'll need a lot of them."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Robot Arm and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
